          "Switch unwanted parts off"
        ],
        "say": "A general monitor emulates a PC, with firmware and a PCI bus, and you switch parts off."
      },
      "right": {
        "title": "NVX machine profile",
        "items": [
          "Linux boots directly, no firmware",
          "Six virtio slots at fixed addresses",
          "Anything else is rejected"
